| LSTM b_f = 3, ∂L/∂c0 | 2.50e+00 (5.05e+00) | 2.38e+00 (4.04e+00) | 2.51e+00 (3.45e+00) | 4.93e+00 (2.07e+00) | 5.40e+00 (8.14e-01) | 1.64e+01 (1.21e-01) |
| LSTM b_f = 5, ∂L/∂c0 | 2.61e+00 (5.27e+00) | 2.87e+00 (5.00e+00) | 3.49e+00 (5.29e+00) | 8.49e+00 (4.89e+00) | 1.42e+01 (4.39e+00) | 1.82e+01 (3.12e+00) |
| GRU b_z = 0 | 2.90e+00 (2.57e+00) | 5.07e-01 (1.69e-01) | 8.01e-02 (7.04e-03) | 1.93e-03 (9.31e-06) | 2.96e-06 (1.47e-11) | 2.21e-11 (9.27e-24) |
| GRU b_z = 3 | 5.03e+00 (5.03e+00) | 4.04e+00 (4.01e+00) | 3.52e+00 (3.37e+00) | 2.23e+00 (2.04e+00) | 1.06e+00 (7.59e-01) | 2.66e-01 (9.41e-02) |
| minGRU b_z = 0 | 2.70e+00 (2.70e+00) | 1.77e-01 (1.77e-01) | 7.86e-03 (7.86e-03) | 1.21e-05 (1.21e-05) | 8.43e-12 (8.43e-12) | 3.03e-24 (3.03e-24) |
| minGRU b_z = −3 | 5.04e+00 (5.04e+00) | 4.00e+00 (4.00e+00) | 3.36e+00 (3.36e+00) | 1.94e+00 (1.94e+00) | 6.97e-01 (6.97e-01) | 7.76e-02 (7.76e-02) |
| minLSTM b_f = 0 | 2.67e+00 (2.67e+00) | 1.59e-01 (1.59e-01) | 6.80e-03 (6.80e-03) | 8.79e-06 (8.79e-06) | 8.11e-12 (8.11e-12) | 6.52e-24 (6.52e-24) |
| minLSTM b_f = 3 | 3.51e+00 (3.51e+00) | 6.31e-01 (6.31e-01) | 9.37e-02 (9.37e-02) | 1.49e-03 (1.49e-03) | 3.83e-07 (3.83e-07) | 1.62e-14 (1.62e-14) |
| IndRNN, ReLU | 2.28e+00 (2.28e+00) | 5.31e-01 (5.31e-01) | 2.24e-01 (2.24e-01) | 2.99e-01 (2.99e-01) | 2.42e-02 (2.42e-02) | 0.00e+00 (0.00e+00) |

